("marco-silveira","Marco Silveira","Gelcoat and Paint Specialist","Dania Beach, FL","(954) 555-0116","marco@example.com","Tue to Sat, 8am to 4pm",[M],"#3E8E7E","Marco restores oxidized gelcoat, applies bottom paint, and spray-finishes topsides. Born in Sao Paulo and trained in Florida yards, he is known for clean prep work, which is why his paint jobs last."),
